fire, with no degrade and no fallback. An operator with members is now fired at
RUN time through jitOpFireRT, which makes the same pick runOP makes. So each
fire -- the compile-fire, the refire and the interpreted oracle alike -- prints
one getDataType refusal and then opPlusEQ's default arm, and nothing degrades.
